<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">Amos</book>
  <para style="h">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amos</para>
  <para style="mt">Amos</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Uzziah le Israel Kumpipa Joash’ tapa Kumpi Jeroboam khan sung, zillin masang kum ni hun lai-in Israel tawh kisai Tekoa tuucingte lahah Amos thugen tam bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in tam bangin ci hi: Zion panin Topa hawhsuh a, Jerusalem khuopi panin ang awng vapuoh hi; tuucingte’ lohingte vulnangin, Carmel muolvum gausan sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Damascus’ khielna thum le li ziehin, ka danpiehna ka dawhkia sih ding hi; azieh pen amate in sia-ha a nei an gawina tawh Gilead a gawt guoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Hazael inn sungah meikuong ka hla ding a, tua in Ben-hadad mun muonhuoite a katum sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damascus khuopi tunkot zawlte ka hliehtawng ding a, Aven Kuoma a teng mite le Beth-eden pana kumpi ciengkhut a tawipa ka sumaimang ding hi; keima in Kir ah Aram-te salin kipeipi ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Gaza thupalsatna thum le li ziehin, danpiehna ka dawhkia sih ding hi; azieh pen amate in Edom tunga ap dingin minambup salin a kai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in Gaza kulbangah meikuong ka hla ding a, tua meikuong in a mun muonhuoite a katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ashdod-a tengte le Ashkelon panin kumpi ciengkhut a tawi pa ka sumaimang ding hi; Ekron khuopi langkhatah ka khut ka hlang ding a, Philistia-te a omlai teng a sigam ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tyre’ khielna thum le li ziehin, danpiehna ka dawhkia sih ding hi; azieh pen amate in Edom-te tungah minambup a ap vua, unau hina dinga thuciemna a phawh kha ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in Tyre kulbangah meikuong ka hla ding a, tua meikuong in a mun muonhuoite a katum sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Edom-te khielna thum le li ziehin, danpiehna ka dawhkia sih ding hi; azieh pen ama in namsau tawh a sanggampa del a, khuotuona lungsim nei lo hi; a tawntungin ama lungthah a, a thangpaina a kem zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n Teman ah meikuong ka hla ding a, tua in Bozrah mun muonhuoite a katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Ammon-te khielna thum le li ziehin, danpiehna ka dawhkia sih ding hi; azieh pen a gam uh a golkeh nadingun, Gilead-a numei gaite’ gil a kuikehpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Rabbah kul tungah mei ka tawkuong ding a, gal kido ni-a kikona le pumpei kipei ni-a huipi tawh tua meikuong in a mun muonhuoite uh katum ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua ciengin a uliente le a kumpipa uh salin a pei ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Moab-te khielna thum le li ziehin, danpiehna ka dawhkia sih ding hi; azieh pen ama in Edom kumpipa’ gute suongkang bangin a haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moab tungah meikuong hla-in tua in Kerioth mun muonhuoite katum ding a, gamlumna awging le pengkul ginte lahah Moab-te si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuate laizangah gam uhpa ka sumaimang ding a, ama tawh uliente zosie ka that ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Judah khielna thum le li ziehin, danpiehna ka dawhkia sih ding hi; azieh pen amate in Topa’ thukham a nuol zo vua, a thu kipte zui loin, hinanle amate in a pu a pate’ na zuisa zuouphuonate tawh, amate lam khielsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Judah tungah meikuong ka hla ding a, tua in Jerusalem mun munhuoite a katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Israel khielna thum le li ziehin, danpiehna ka dawhkia sih ding hi; azieh pen amate in ngun tawh midihte a zua vua, amate in kedap kop tawh mi tasamte a zua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in mizawngte’ lutang leivui lahah a tuoncil vua, lampi panin mi gentheite a sawnnawp uhi; ka min siengtho a buasah dingin, nungah khat kungah a pa le a tapa a pei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />maitam cinteng tungah a lum vua, vankhap a kila puonte a netpha uhi; amate in a Pasien uh’ inn sungah a mi gapna uh zu a dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanle keima in a mai vuah taamtah sing banga a sang le gangpi sing banga a sah Amor-te ka suhsiet pieh hi; keima in a tunga a ga le a nei-a a huite ka susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note zong Egypt gam pan kang peipi to a, Amor-te leitang a luo dingin kum sawmli sung senel gamah kang pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tapate uh pawlkhat kamsangin ka pangsah a, na khangnote uh pawlkhat nazir mi ka hisah hi. Tam bang ma hi lo amah, Israel mite aw, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle note in nazir mite zu na dawnsah vua, kamsangte thu pie-in, “Thu phuong sih un,” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n bulomte a dim ciengin bawngleng a netsuh bangin, keima in na opna mun vuah note kang nensuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tai hatte a suohta sih ding vua, a tha hatte in a hatna uh a zang man sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />thaltawite in a do zo sih ding vua, a malgangte amau le amau kihunzo tuom loin, sakol tunga tuongte in a hinna uh a humbih zo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin mihatte lahah a hangsan pente zong a guohtangin taimang ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite aw, Egypt gam pana kang peipi innkuonte zosie, note langkhatah Topa thugen za un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung innkuon zosie lahah no beh kang thei ahi bo hi; tua ahi ziehin keima in na khielna zosie ziehun dan kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kiciemkholna om loin mi ni a zawhton thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A samat ding a nei lo ciengin gamlah ah humpi a mawh hawh amah? Samat bangma a nei lo ciengin a kuo sungah humpi khanglai a mawh ham amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thang-anta a op sih le lei lahah a kisie thangah vata a mawh aw amah? Bangma awh lopi-in leilah panin thang a kimawh sai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuopi sungah pengkul a kimut ciengin mite a zau sih uh amah? Topa’ tunsah lo pi-in khuopi sungah gimna a tung amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tahtahin Topa in ama’ nasem kamsangte tungah a thusim gen lopi-in na sem lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Humpi hawh zo hi; koi ahiei a giing lo ding? Topa in gen zo hi; koi ahiei a thu phuong ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ashod mun muonhuoite le Egypt gama mun muonhuoite-ah phuongzah inlen, “Samaria Muol ah kikhawm unlen, a sunga buoina lienpite en un. Tua khuopi laikima a om bawlsietnate hing en un,” ci un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a mana gamtat ding a thei sih vua, mun muonhuoite sungah tatsietna le guhtatna a khol uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Galte in tua gam kuikhumin, na kihunna uh a la ding uhi; na mun muonhuoite uzong kibulu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tuucing pa in humpi kamhawm panin tuu keng ni, ahi sihle a bil themkhat a hunkhiet ma bangin topha nip ningkiu khat le lupna themkhat tunga a to Samaria khuo sunga a teng Israel mite kihunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vanglien Pasien ahi, Topa Pasien in ci hi: Za unlen Jacob innkuonte langah teci pang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A khielna ziehin Israel dan ka pieh ni-in, Bethel maitam dan ka pie ding a, maitam kite tawngsanin tuolah a kiesuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Phalbi inn le khal inn ka phel ding a, saiha innte kisie-in inn thupite tawpmang ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mizawngte nengniemin mi tasamte gawt a, a pasalte kungah, “Ka dawn ding bangkhat ei pie vawi!” ci-in a gen, Samaria Muoltunga a om no Bashan bawngpite aw,” tami thu ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A siengthona tawh Topa Pasien kiciem zo hi: Amate in note siakawi tawh ang kaidawh ding hun ang tung valon ding a, a nukhia pente nangawn ngakuoi tawh ang kai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kulvang zui-in na pitdawh ding vua, a mailam vuah mi zosie tangtahin pei ding uhi; Harmon muolah na kisengnawp ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bethel ah hing pei unlen khielna bawl un; Gilgal ah hing pei unlen, khielna khangsah un; zingmawng sielin na kithoinate uh tawi unlen, nithum sielin na sawm-a-khatte uh tawi un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tol kisaw lungdamna biehna tawi unlen, na dei dan uh biehnate phuongzahin tuate gen un; bangzieh ahei cile tam banga bawl ding pen na dei dan uh ahi hi, Israel mite aw! Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na khuopi zosie vuah ha sienthona kang pie a, na tenna mun zosie vuah neh tasamin kang koi a, hinanle ka kungah nang kilekia tuom sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka anlah hun ding hla thum a sap laitahin, note tungah guo a zuh ding ka kham hi; khuopi khatah guo zusahin, adang khatah ka zusah sih hi; lo khat tungah guo zu a, guo zuh lona lo a gawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n tui sui dingin khuopi ni le thuma mite khuopi khatah a vah kawikawi vua, a tai zo sih uhi; hinanle kei kungah nang kilekia tuom sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huisapi le maibuoh natna tawh kang sugawp hi; na umte ule na lenggui lote a hawmguohin ka koi hi; kauphe in na theikungte ule na olive kungte uh a netum sieng hi; hinanle ka kungah nang kilekia tuom sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Egypt gama ka tunsah dan bangin note lahah pul natna kang tungsah hi; na tangvalte uh namsau tawh ka satlia hi; na sakolte uh kang kaimangpieh hi; na nahhawm sung vuah na giephuol vua sil uite ka lut tosah hi; hinanle kei kungah nang kilekia tuom sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien in Sodom le Gomorah a lumle bangin mi pawlkhat ka lumlet ding a, meikuong lai-a a kiladawh singthem tawh na kibang ding uhi; hinanle ka kungah nang kilekia tuom sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel aw, nang tungah tam bangin kang bawl ding hi: Na tungah tami hing bawl ding ka hi ziehin, Israel aw! na Pasien tawh a kimu dingin kisakhol in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile en in, muolte bawlin huite a siem pa, a ngaisutna mi kunga a pulah pa, zingmawng khuomiel suohsahin leitung munsang teng a tuoncil pa, a min Vanglien Pasien, Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, kaateng lo kawmin na kung vuah kang gen tam thu khu ngai un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel ngahnu pua a, a thokia nawn sih hi; a gam sungah kipampai a, a phongto ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Mi tulkhat a kuonsah khuopi ah mi zakhat hing lai ding a, mi zakhat a kuonsah khuopi ah mi sawm hing lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in Israel innkuon tungah tam bang ci hi: Keima ei sui unlen hing un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hinanle Bethel sui sih unlen, Gilgal ah lut loin, Beer-sheba ah zong galkai sih un; azieh pen salin Gilgal pei valon ding a, Bethel zong bangma lo a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa sui un, tua hile na hing ding uhi. na sui sih uleh Joseph innkuon tungah mei bangin ang kuong ding a, tua mei in Bethel katumin koima in a phel zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thutang lumletin aicim kha suohsah a, thudih tuol denna a nei note in gimna thuoh man va uciei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawmluoi le Zawlzawng a bawl, khuomiel zingmawng a suohsah, sunlai zan banga a mielsah, tuipi panin tuite hlanin lei maitanga tua tuite a sungsuh pa, ama’ min Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihatte suhsiet nadingin mallang mama a, tuaci’n kulpi tungah sietna a tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in tunkota thuhil pa a muda vua, amate in thuman gente a huo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi zehin mizawngte tuoncilin, amau kung panin ankaihte na lah ziehun, suong kilem innte lam nan locin a sungah na tengkha sih ding uhi; a dei huoi lengga lote bawl nan locin lenggazu na dawn kha sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na khielna za ule na mawnate uh a liet lam ka thei a, midihte genthei bawlin guhgol na la vua, khuopi tunkot ah mi tasamte na sawnpua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tam bang hun ciengin, mi pilvangte a sip khinkhian ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile tua hun pen hunsie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na hin thei nadingun hoina sui un, gitlona sui sih un; na gensa bangun Vanglien Topa Pasien in note ang ompi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gitlona muda-in thu hoi dei unlen, khuopi tunkot ah thutang sukip un; Joseph minam a omlai teng, Topa , Vanglien Pasien in ang lainat kha thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa , Vanglien Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Khuolai mun-awng zosie ah kaa le mau om ding hi; amate in lamdung zosie ah, “Kadeisei! kadeisei!” a ci ding uhi. Amate in a kap dingin lohlote a ciel ding vua, a thum a mau dingin kaateng law siemte a ciel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na laikim vuah kang kansan ding ziehin, lengga lo zosie ah kaana le mauna om ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa’ ni ang tun ding a lunggul note in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Topa’ ni bang dinga na lunggul uh ahei? Tua ni pen khuomiel hi a, khuovah hi lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Humpi kung pana a tai, vompi khat tawh kituoh mi khat tawh kibang ding hi; ahi sihle a inn sungah lutin kawma khut a ngap ciengin gul in a tuh mipa tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa’ ni pen khuovah hi loin khuomiel ni hi a, a sungah a tang a om lo khuomiel ni hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na biehna pawite uh ka muda a, ka thupisim sih hi, na khawmpi bawlte un ka lung a kimsah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima kungah na meihal biehnate ule an tawh biehnate nang tawi vangun, tuate ka sang sih ding hi; thunuom biehna dinga nang peipi uh na ganthaute uzong etin ka nei vet sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lasah gamlumnate uh khawl un; na harp lasahna tumgingte uh ka ngai vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thutang, tui bangin luongsah unlen, dihna, a kang ngai lo luitui bangin luongsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, senel gamah kum sawmli na op sungun keima kungah biehpiehnate le biehnate nang tawi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note in noma dinga na bawltawm uh na kumpipa uh Sakkuth le na aasi-pasien uh ahi na milimte uh na puo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Damascus galkhatah sal dingin kang kai ding hi, ama’ min Vanglien Pasien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion ah nuomtaha a tengte, Samaria Muol tungah lungmuonga a omte, minamte’ ulien pente, Israel innkuonte’ muon le suonte, gimna thuoh man va uciei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Calneh ah galkai-in va en ta un; khum panin khuopi lien Hamath ah va pei un; tua ciengin Philistia gam Gath ah peisuh un. Tua kumpi gamte sangin note na hoizaw uh amah? Ahi sihle note’ leitang sangin amau’ leitang a hoizaw amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sietna ni ang tun ding gamlapi-a a khinto note aw, tatsietna ang tun ding hun na naisah uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saiha lupna tunga a lum, a lupna tung vua a lum hit hiette, tuuhon lahah tuuno sa le bawnghon lahah bawngno sa deih zaza a ne mite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David bangin tumging tumin, harp tawh langui a sa mite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nohai golpite tawh zu dawn a, sathau hoipente tawh amau le amau kinoi-in, hizongle Joseph’ kisietna thu-ah a dapi lo note in gimna thuoh man va uciei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in amate khu sala pei masa pente ahi ding vua, a thada mite’ guolnopna a tawpmang ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa Pasien ama le ama kiciem zo hi, (Topa , Vanglien Pasien in tam bangin ci hi): Keima in Jacob’ kiphatsahna ka huo a, a mun muonhuoite ka muda hi; tua khuopi le a sunga om zosie mi khut sungah ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inn khat sungah mi sawm a op lai uleh amate a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale misi a hal a sanggam pa khat in inn sung panin tua siluong ladawhin puo ding a, inn dan sungta pena a om pa khat kungah, “Na oppi uh midang a om lai ei?” ci ding a, “Om sih,” ci-in kidawng ding hi. Tua ciengin tua a sanggam pa in, “Ham sih vawi! Eite in Topa’ min lo kha vawt sih vai,” a ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En un, Topa in thu pie a, inn golpi kisatguoi-in inn neute kisatzan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suong tungah sakolte a tai ngel amah? Mi khat in bawngtangte tawh tuipi a hlo amah? Hinanle note in thutang, gu na suohsah ta vua, dihna, gamsai na suohsah ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lo-debar khuo ah guolnuomin, “Eite in eima adingin i thahatna utawh Karnaim i lah uh hi lo amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, ang do dingin minam khat ka khangsah valon ding hi, Vanglien Pasien, Topa in ci hi. Amate in Lebo-hamath panin Arabah Lui dongin note ang gawt ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa Pasien in keima ei lah khu tam ahi hi: Lopa a dawng nukhia ding pen a dawn pat laitahin ama in kauphete omsah a, (tua khu kumpipa’ lopa a ki-at zaw lopa a dawn nukhia hun tah ahi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in khum gama lopate a khawn sieng zaw ciengun keima in, Topa Pasien aw, ei maisah in, hing thum ingh! Jacob in bangci thuoh zo ding ahei? Ama neu seng luo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in tam tawh kisai-in a lungsim a khel hi; “Tam thu pieng nawn lo ding hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa Pasien in keima ei lah pen tami ahi hi: Topa Pasien in meikuong hlanin, tua meikuong in tui thuhpite katum a, gamsung teng a haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, Topa Pasien aw, khawl in, hing thum ingh! Jacob in bangci thuoh zo ding ahei? Ama neu seng luo hi!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in tam tawh kisai-in a lungsim a khel hi; “Tam thu pieng nawn lo ding hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa Pasien keima ei lah khu tami ahi hi: Khaukhai tawh a kilam kawm khat’ gei-ah a khut sungah khaukhai khat tawi-in Topa a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale Topa in keima kungah, “Amos, bang na mu ei?” ei ci hi. Keima in, “Khaukhai khat,” ka ci hi. Tua ciengin Topa in, En vawi, ka mi Israel laikim ah khaukhai khat ka koi hi. Amate dan pieh ka sawm khu ka khel ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isaac’ munsang teng gamkhing kisuohsah ding a, Israel’ munsiengtho teng a hawmguohin kikoi ding hi. Jeroboam innkuon do dingin namsau tawh ka kuon ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Bethel siempu Amaziah in Israel Kumpi Jeroboam kungah mi sawl a, “Amos in Israel innkuon laikim ah nangma ang do sawm hi; gamsung mite in ama’ thugen a nang zo nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen Amos in tam bangin thu gen hi, ‘Namsau tawh Jeroboam si ding a, ama’ gam panin a gamlapi munah Israel salin a pei ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale Amaziah in Amos kungah, “Thumu pa aw, pei-in Judah gamah taimang inlen, khum sungah na neh ding va kisui ta’nlen, khum sungah thu va hil ta’n;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bethel ah thu hing gen nawn poma sin, bangzieh ahei cile tami mun pen kumpite’ mun siengtho ahi a, kumpi gam biehinnpi ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Amos in Amaziah kungah, “Kei kamsang ka hi sih a, kamsangpa’ tapa zong ka hi sih hi; tuucing le theiba um a puo mipa khat ka hi lel bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in tuute ka cinna panin keima ei la a, Topa in, keima kungah, ‘Pei inlen ka mi Israel-te kungah thu va gen ta’n,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tua ahi ziehin tu-in Topa thu gen za in. ‘Israel langkhatah thu gen sinlen, Isaac innkuon langkhatah zong thu gen sin,’ nei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin ci hi: ‘Na zi pen khuopi sungah na numei pahtat suoh ding a, na tanu le na tapate pen namsau tawh pua-in, khau tawh na gam kite ding a, a kihawmthang ding hi; a siengtho gam sungah nang mama na si ding a, ama’ gam panin Israel salin a pei valon ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa Pasien in keima ei lah khu tami ahi hi. Khal singga bawng khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “Amos aw, bang na mu ei?” ei ci hi. Keima in, “Khal singga bawng khat,” ka ci hi. Tua ciengin Topa in keima kungah, “Ka mi Israel-te tungah tawpna hun a tung zo hi; amate dan ka pieh ding ka khelkia ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ni-in biehinn sunga la kisate kaala a suoh ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi; “Misi luong tam ding a, mun zosie-ah kipaithang ding hi. Gamdai un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tasamte tuoncilin gam sung mizawngte a suhsiet sawmte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“I an uh i zua thei nadingin bang hun ciengin hla tha tawp ding a; i mangbu uh i zua thei nadingin bang hun ciengin sabbath tawp ding ahei? Antena ephah neusahin, shekel i golsah ding uhi. A man lo tawisuong tawh i zuou gamtat ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ngun tawh mizawngte lei-in kedap bukhat tawh tasam liengvaite i lei ding a, a kisu lo mangbu site i zua ding uhi,” a ci note aw, tam thu za vawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jacob’ kiphatsahna tawh Topa a kiciem hi: A tahtahin amau’ nasepte ka mangngil ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami ziehin lei kiling loin a sunga a teng zosie kapin, tuate a unpi-un Nile gun bangin khang a, tui tungah lam kawikawi-in, Egypt gama Nile gun bangin kiemsuhkia lo ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin keima in sunkim laipi-in ni ka tumsah ding a, sunkim laipi ma-in khuo ka mielsah ding hi. Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na biehna pawite uh dana ka suohsah ding a, na lasahte zosie uzong kaana ka suohsah ding hi; mi zosie in a kawng vuah la-ip puon gahsahin, lutang a kici zosie ka heukieusah ding hi; tapa khat neisun a si zieha kikaana ka bangsah ding a, a tawpna khu genthei ni ka hisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gam sungah kielpi ka tunsah ding hun ang tung valon ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi; tua khu an le tui dugawna kielpi hi loin, Topa’ thu zahnopna kielpi hizaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuipi khat pan tuipi khat, leilu panin nisuona dong amate a vah kawikawi ding uhi; ahi vangin amate in a mu zo sih ding uhi. Topa’ thu kanin a tai kawikawi ding vua, ahi vangin amate in a mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin ngahnu melhoite le tangvalte dangta-in a husam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samaria’ pasien Ashimah minin kiciem a, “Dan aw, na pasien pen a hing zing ahi ma bangin,” a cite le “Beer-sheba lampi a hing zing ahi ma bangin,” a ci amate a pua ding vua, a thokia nawn sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima in maitam gei-a a ding Topa ka mu a, ama in: Biehinn bulpite a kilin dongin khuompiluzang zepnate satcim inlen, mizosie’ lutungah tuate tusah in; Keima in a suohta teng namsau tawh ka that ding hi; koima khat beh tai mang loin, koima khat beh suohta lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Misikhuo sungah lei to nan ule, khum panin ka khut tawh ka ladawh veve ding hi; vantung dongah kato nan ule, khum panin ka khiesuh veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Carmel muolvum ah kiphuol nan ule, khum panin sui-in ka ladawh veve ding hi; ka muna panin tuipi tawngah kiphuol nan ule, khum sungah tuipi-gulpi thu ka pie ding a, tua gul in ka tusah veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A galte uh mai-ah salin pei nan ule, khum sungah namsau thu ka pie ding a, amate ka thatsah veve ding hi; amau’ hoi nading hi loin, a siet nadingun amate mittuhna-in ka nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien in leitung a tham ciengin tui suohin, leitunga a teng zosiete a kap amau vua, a unpi-un Nile gun bangin khang vapualin, Egypt gama Nile gun bangin a kiemsuhkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in vantungah inndan tungnung lam a, leitang tung lamah vanthamzawl phut hi; tuipi panin tuite hlan a, lei maitanga tuate a sungsuh pa, tam banga a bawl pa’ ama’ min Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mite aw, kei adingin Ethiopia mite tawh a kibang hi lo na hi uh amah? Topa in ci hi. Keima in Israel-te, Egypt pan, Philistia-te, Caphtor pan le Aram-te, Kir panin peipi to hi lo ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa Pasien in mawna a nei kumpi gamte mittuhna-in nei ding a, lei maitang panin Jacob innkuonte simlo, ka sumaimang ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in thu ka pie ding a, nam zosie lahah Israel innkuonte, gawdal-a ki zoi bangin ka zoi ding a, ahi vangin suongtang khat zong tuolah a kie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Sietna in eite ei pha sih va,” a ci ka mi mawneite zosie, namsau-in a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin a puasa David’ buh phongto-in a vang teng ka phawbih ding a, a kisie teng zong phongto-in tanglai huna bangin ka lamphakia ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua khu amate in Edom a omlai teng le ka mina a kihlan minam zosie a luo thei nading uh ahi hi, tami a bawl Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lokai pa in bu-at pa a makhel ding hun, lengga cilpa in a khaici tupa a makhel ding hun ang tung valon ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Muolsangte panin lenggazu hlum taasuh ding a, muoltang zosie panin lenggazu luong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Agam vuah ka mi Israel-te ka tutkia ding a, amate in a kisiesa khuopite lamphakia-in a tang ding uhi. Amate in lenggui suonin a zute a dawn ding vua, um bawlin a gate a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka piehsa leitang panin amate ka phungkal ngai ta sih ding a, a leitang tung vuah amate ka suon ding hi, Topa na Pasien un ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
